WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.171
Mommy and Daddy take turns reading books to us.

2
00:00:04.172 --> 00:00:07.552
It was Daddy's turn tonight.

3
00:00:07.553 --> 00:00:09.874
Dad: Did you choose the

4
00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:14.105
book? Bada: Yes. I would like this book

5
00:00:14.106 --> 00:00:17.648
tonight. Dad: Okay. Let's read this

6
00:00:17.649 --> 00:00:19.812
storybook. Do you know what it's about?

7
00:00:19.813 --> 00:00:21.839
Bada: I'm not sure.

8
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.598
Something about a snail? Dad:

9
00:00:24.599 --> 00:00:29.841
That's right. It's about a snail with a big house.

10
00:00:29.842 --> 00:00:33.793
Bada: Hmm. That sounds interesting.

11
00:00:33.794 --> 00:00:36.826
Dad: Your sister loved this book.

12
00:00:36.827 --> 00:00:38.380
Bada: Come on, Dad.

13
00:00:38.381 --> 00:00:40.737
Please read it to me. Dad:

14
00:00:40.738 --> 00:00:42.867
Here we go. Bada

15
00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:46.182
is usually wild and active.

16
00:00:46.183 --> 00:00:52.893
However, when it comes to reading, he becomes such a good boy.

